msgid "%{19m} can also be declared in the same manner as north winds."
msgstr "%{19m} 也可以像北風一樣宣告。"

msgid "%{ankan} are hidden: its tiles are not visible for the rest of the table until the end of the round."
msgstr "%{ankan} 是暗槓：在該局結束前，其牌不會對其他玩家公開。"

