msgid "During a round, if a player draws a flower they may replace it with a tile from the wall in the same manner. This is done automatically, but you can turn off this behavior by pressing the F button at the bottom."
msgstr "對局中，玩家若摸到花牌，可以同樣方式從牌山替換一張牌。此動作會自動執行，但你可以按底部的 F 按鈕關閉此行為。"

msgid "Each 1 or 6 die rolled in the beginning adds 1 han to the winning hand. If they add to 7, an additional 1 han is added. This does not count towards any han minimum."
msgstr "開局擲出的每顆 1 或 6 點骰子可為和牌手牌加 1 番。若其合計為 7，則額外加 1 番。此不計入任何番數最低要求。"

msgid "Each 2000 Bet"
msgstr "每次 2000 押注"

msgid "Each aka dora scores shuugi."
msgstr "每張赤寶牌可得籌碼。"

msgid "Each ao dora scores shuugi."
msgstr "每張青寶牌可得籌碼。"

msgid "Each kin dora scores shuugi."
msgstr "每張金寶牌可得籌碼。"

msgid "Each of your sets and pair contains a terminal or honor tile."
msgstr "你的每組面子及雀頭皆含有一張么九牌或字牌。"

msgid "Each payment between the dealer and another player is multiplied by 2 for every dealer challenge issued this round."
msgstr "莊家與其他玩家之間的每筆支付，依本局發出的每次莊家挑戰乘以 2。"

msgid "Each player starts with %{starting_shuugi} chips."
msgstr "每位玩家起始持有 %{starting_shuugi} 個籌碼。"

msgid "Each player starts with a set amount of points. Players' point totals can't go negative. If a player runs out of points, they need not pay."
msgstr "每位玩家起始持有固定點數。玩家的點數總計不可為負。若玩家點數用盡，則無須支付。"

msgid "Each quad (Coong) of any type awards you 1 Phán each. If you have four Quads, you are instead awarded Four Quads (4 Mủn!)."
msgstr "任何種類的每組槓（Coong）各可得 1 番。若你有四組槓，則改計四槓（4 Mủn！）。"

msgid "Each round always starts with a flower declaration round. Starting from the East seat, each player replaces flowers in hand, or declares \\\"No Flowers\\\"."
msgstr "每局總是以花牌宣告回合開始。從東家開始，每位玩家替換手中的花牌，或宣告「無花」。"

msgid "Each suit now runs from one to ten: %{tens}"
msgstr "每個花色現在從一到十：%{tens}"

msgid "Each tile in the wall is transparent and visible to all, except for one copy. Unflipped dora indicators are not visible."
msgstr "牌山中的每張牌皆透明且對所有人可見，但其中一張例外。未翻開的寶牌指示牌不可見。"

msgid "Each ura dora scores shuugi."
msgstr "每張裡寶牌可得籌碼。"

msgid "Earthly Hand"
msgstr "地和"

msgid "Earthly Win"
msgstr "地和"

msgid "East Round Only"
msgstr "僅東場"

msgid "East just discarded a 1 of bamboo. With your 1 of characters and 1 of circles in hand, in cosmic riichi, you may call Chon to form a mixed triplet (kontsu). Try it now."
msgstr "東家剛打出 1 索。由於你手中有 1 萬和 1 筒，在宇宙立直中，你可以鳴重（Chon）來組成混刻。現在試試看。"

msgid "Edge Wait"
msgstr "邊張聽"

msgid "Eight Flowers"
msgstr "八花"

msgid "Eighteen Arhats"
msgstr "十八羅漢"

msgid "Empty"
msgstr "空"

msgid "Enable 4 kan abortive draw."
msgstr "啟用四槓流局。"

msgid "Enable 4 riichi abortive draw."
msgstr "啟用四立直流局。"

msgid "Enable 4 wind abortive draw."
msgstr "啟用四風流局。"

msgid "Enable 9 distinct terminal/honor abortive draw."
msgstr "啟用九種么九牌流局。"

msgid "Enable Chii"
msgstr "啟用吃牌"

msgid "Enable busting. Once anyone's points is reduced below zero (or the specified value), the game ends."
msgstr "啟用擊飛。一旦任何人的點數降至零以下（或指定值），遊戲結束。"

msgid "Enable called game. Once anyone's points reaches above 54999 (or the specified value), the game ends."
msgstr "啟用箱下。一旦任何人的點數達到 54999 以上（或指定值），遊戲結束。"

msgid "Enable chantaiyaochuu (\\\"All Contains Honors/Terminals\\\") and junchantaiyaochuu (\\\"All Contains Terminals\\\"). 1 han if every set/pair in your hand contains an honor or terminal, +1 han if your hand is closed (no calls besides ankan). 2 han instead if each set/pair contains a terminal with no honor tiles, again +1 han if your hand is closed."
msgstr "啟用混全帶么九（「每組皆含字牌／么九牌」）及純全帶么九（「每組皆含么九牌」）。若手中每組面子／雀頭皆含一張字牌或么九牌，得 1 番；若手牌門清（除暗槓外無鳴牌），額外 +1 番。若每組面子／雀頭皆含一張么九牌且無字牌，則改為 2 番，同樣門清時 +1 番。"

msgid "Enable chiitoitsu. \\\"Seven Pairs\\\". Enables winning with a seven pair hand, which also scores 2 han."
msgstr "啟用七對子（「Seven Pairs」）。啟用後可以七對子手牌和了，並計 2 番。"

msgid "Enable chuurenpoutou. \\\"Nine Connected Lanterns\\\". Yakuman if your hand (including winning tile) has no calls and looks like 1112345678999 of any suit, plus one additional tile of that suit. Double yakuman if your hand (no winning tile) contains exactly 1112345678999, which is a nine-sided wait."
msgstr "啟用九蓮寶燈（「Nine Connected Lanterns」）。若你的手牌（含和牌）沒有鳴牌，且為任一花色的 1112345678999 再加一張同花色牌，即為役滿。若你的手牌（不含和牌）恰為 1112345678999（九面聽），則為雙倍役滿。"

msgid "Enable furiten. Furiten prevents you from winning on a discard if you have previously discarded that tile, or if you skipped winning on the same tile this turn."
msgstr "啟用振聽。若你先前曾打出該牌，或本巡跳過了以同一張牌和了的機會，振聽會使你無法以打出的牌和了。"

msgid "Enable head bump. In case of multiple hu, only the person closest in turn order gets the win."
msgstr "啟用頭跳。若有多家和了，只有打牌順序上最接近的人可獲和了。"

msgid "Enable head bump. In case of multiple ron, only the person closest in turn order gets the win."
msgstr "啟用頭跳。若有多家榮和，只有打牌順序上最接近的人可獲和了。"

msgid "Enable honitsu. \\\"Mixed One-Color\\\". 2 han if your hand consists of a single suit plus honor tiles, +1 han if your hand is closed (no calls besides ankan). Also enables chinitsu (\\\"Pure One-Color\\\"), which is 5 han if your hand consists of a single suit (no honor tiles), +1 han if your hand is closed."
msgstr "啟用混一色（「Mixed One-Color」）。若你的手牌由單一花色加上字牌組成，得 2 番；若手牌門清（除暗槓外無鳴牌），額外 +1 番。同時啟用清一色（「Pure One-Color」）：若手牌由單一花色組成（無字牌），得 5 番；若手牌門清，額外 +1 番。"

msgid "Enable honroutou. \\\"Mixed Terminals and Honors\\\". 1 han if your hand is composed only of terminals (1,9 tiles) and honor tiles. Also enables chinroutou (\\\"Pure Terminals and Honors\\\") which is yakuman if your hand is composed only of terminals (no honors)."
msgstr "啟用混老頭（「Mixed Terminals and Honors」）。若你的手牌僅由么九牌（1、9）及字牌組成，得 1 番。同時啟用清老頭（「Pure Terminals and Honors」）：若手牌僅由么九牌組成（無字牌），即為役滿。"

msgid "Enable ikkitsuukan. \\\"Punch Through in One Go\\\". 1 han if your hand contains 123 456 789 in one suit, +1 han if your hand is closed (no calls besides ankan)."
msgstr "啟用一氣通貫（「Punch Through in One Go」）。若你的手牌在同一花色中包含 123 456 789，得 1 番；若手牌門清（除暗槓外無鳴牌），額外 +1 番。"

msgid "Enable kokushi musou. \\\"Peerless Warriors\\\". Yakuman if your hand (including winning tile) contains all 13 terminals and honors, plus an extra one forming a pair. Double yakuman if your hand (no winning tile) contains all 13 terminals and honors, waiting on a 13-sided wait for a pair."
msgstr "啟用國士無雙。若你的手牌（含和牌）包含全部 13 種么九牌與字牌，其中一種再添一張成對，即為役滿。若你的手牌（不含和牌）包含全部 13 種么九牌與字牌，並以十三面聽等成對，則為雙倍役滿。"

msgid "Enable nagashi mangan. When you discards are all terminals and honors at exhaustive draw, and none of your discards have been called, then you are paid mangan tsumo at draw."
msgstr "啟用流局滿貫。流局時，若你的捨牌全為么九牌與字牌，且你的捨牌皆未被鳴取，則你在流局時獲得滿貫自摸的支付。"

msgid "Enable oka. Everyone antes the given amount, and the total is awarded to first place at the end of the game."
msgstr "啟用賭注（オカ）。每人先繳交指定金額，總額在遊戲結束時頒給第一名。"

msgid "Enable renhou. \\\"Hand of Man\\\". Instant mangan or yakuman if you win off a discard before your first draw. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "啟用人和（「Hand of Man」）。若你在第一次摸牌前以打出的牌和了，立即獲得滿貫或役滿。鳴牌會使其失效。"

msgid "Enable riichi declarations. When you are tenpai with at least 1000 points (and it is not your last discard), you may declare riichi before discarding. If the discard passes, you automatically bet 1000 and can no longer change your hand. If you win under this condition, you get the riichi yaku (1 han). If you riichi on your first discard (calls invalidate), this is called Double Riichi and worth 2 han."
msgstr "啟用立直宣告。當你聽牌且持有至少 1000 點（且非你的最後一張捨牌）時，你可以在打牌前宣告立直。若該捨牌通過，你自動押注 1000 點，且無法再改變手牌。若你在此條件下和了，可獲得立直役（1 番）。若你在第一次打牌時立直（鳴牌會使其失效），稱為雙立直，值 2 番。"

msgid "Enable ryuuiisou. \\\"Green One-Color\\\". Yakuman if your hand is composed only of 23468 bamboo and/or green dragon."
msgstr "啟用綠一色（「Green One-Color」）。若你的手牌僅由 23468 索及／或發組成，即為役滿。"

msgid "Enable sanankou. \\\"Three Concealed Triplets\\\". 2 han if your hand contains three closed triplets. A closed triplet is a triplet hidden in hand, or a triplet formed by self-draw. Also enables the yakuman suuankou (\\\"Four Concealed Triplets\\\") and double yakuman suuankou tanki (\\\"Four Concealed Triplets Single-Wait\\\")."
msgstr "啟用三暗刻（「Three Concealed Triplets」）。若你的手牌中有三組暗刻，得 2 番。暗刻即暗藏於手中的刻子，或以自摸完成的刻子。同時啟用役滿四暗刻及雙倍役滿四暗刻單騎。"

msgid "Enable sankantsu (\\\"Three Kans\\\"). 2 han if you called three kans."
msgstr "啟用三槓子（「Three Kans」）。若你鳴了三組槓，得 2 番。"

msgid "Enable sanshoku doujun. \\\"Three-Colored Same Sequence\\\". 1 han if your hand contains the same numbered sequence in three suits, +1 han if your hand is closed (no calls besides ankan)."
msgstr "啟用三色同順（「Three-Colored Same Sequence」）。若你的手牌在三個花色中包含相同數字的順子，得 1 番；若手牌門清（除暗槓外無鳴牌），額外 +1 番。"

msgid "Enable sanshoku doukou. \\\"Three-Colored Same Triplet\\\". 1 han if your hand contains the same numbered triplet in three suits, +1 han if your hand is closed (no calls besides ankan)."
msgstr "啟用三色同刻（「Three-Colored Same Triplet」）。若你的手牌在三個花色中包含相同數字的刻子，得 1 番；若手牌門清（除暗槓外無鳴牌），額外 +1 番。"

msgid "Enable shousangen. \\\"Little Three Dragons\\\". 2 han (on top of yakuhai) if your hand contains two dragon triplets and a pair of the third. Also enables daisangen (\\\"Big Three Dragons\\\"), which is yakuman for having three dragon triplets."
msgstr "啟用小三元（「Little Three Dragons」）。若你的手牌包含兩組三元牌刻子及第三種三元牌的對子，得 2 番（外加役牌）。同時啟用大三元（「Big Three Dragons」）：擁有三組三元牌刻子即為役滿。"

msgid "Enable shousuushii. \\\"Little Four Happiness\\\". Yakuman if your hand contains three wind triplets/kans, with a pair of the fourth. Also enables daisuushii (\\\"Big Four Happiness\\\") which is double yakuman if your hand contains four wind triplets/kans."
msgstr "啟用小四喜（「Little Four Happiness」）。若你的手牌包含三組風牌刻子／槓及第四種風的對子，即為役滿。同時啟用大四喜（「Big Four Happiness」）：若手牌包含四組風牌刻子／槓，即為雙倍役滿。"

msgid "Enable suukantsu (\\\"Four Kans\\\"). 2 han if you called three kans."
msgstr "啟用四槓子（「Four Kans」）。若你鳴了三組槓，得 2 番。"

msgid "Enable tenhou and chiihou. \\\"Heavenly/Earthly Win\\\". Yakuman if you win with your first draw as dealer (Tenhou) or as non-dealer (Chiihou). Calls invalidate."
msgstr "啟用天和與地和（「Heavenly/Earthly Win」）。若你身為莊家（天和）或閒家（地和）以第一次摸牌和了，即為役滿。鳴牌會使其失效。"

msgid "Enable toitoihou. \\\"All Triplets\\\". 2 han if your hand consists of four triplets and a pair."
msgstr "啟用對對和（「All Triplets」）。若你的手牌由四組刻子及一對雀頭組成，得 2 番。"

msgid "Enable triple ron abortive draw."
msgstr "啟用三家榮和流局。"

msgid "Enable tsuuiisou. \\\"One-Color Characters\\\". Yakuman if your hand is composed only of honor tiles."
msgstr "啟用字一色（「One-Color Characters」）。若你的手牌僅由字牌組成，即為役滿。"

msgid "Enable uma. At the end of the game, points are awarded or deducted based on placement."
msgstr "啟用名次獎金（ウマ）。遊戲結束時，依名次給予或扣除點數。"

msgid "Enable zan shuugi: having 4 flowers is 10 chips ron / 5 chips tsumo. Same payment for non-kazoe yakuman."
msgstr "啟用殘籌碼：擁有 4 張花牌為榮和 10 籌碼／自摸 5 籌碼。非累計役滿也給予相同支付。"

msgid "Enables aka dora (red fives), worth 1 han each."
msgstr "啟用赤寶牌（紅五），每張值 1 番。"

msgid "Enables ao dora (blue fives), worth 2 han each."
msgstr "啟用青寶牌（藍五），每張值 2 番。"

msgid "Enables chankan. \\\"Robbing a Kan\\\". 1 han if you win off a player adding a drawn tile to an existing pon to form a kan."
msgstr "啟用搶槓（「Robbing a Kan」）。若你在他家將摸到的牌加進既有的碰組成槓時和了，得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables dora flip on kan."
msgstr "啟用槓時翻寶牌。"

msgid "Enables dora."
msgstr "啟用寶牌。"

msgid "Enables haitei (\\\"Under the Sea\\\") and houtei (\\\"Under the River\\\"). 1 han if you win by drawing the last tile (Haitei) or by claiming the last discard (Houtai)."
msgstr "啟用海底撈月（「Under the Sea」）與河底撈魚（「Under the River」）。若你以摸到最後一張牌（海底）或以最後一張捨牌（河底）和了，得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables honba."
msgstr "啟用本場。"

msgid "Enables iipeikou (\\\"Identical Sequences\\\") and ryanpeikou (\\\"Twice Identical Sequences\\\"). 1 han if you have the exact same sequence twice, 3 han if you have two of those in your hand."
msgstr "啟用一盃口（「Identical Sequences」）與二盃口（「Twice Identical Sequences」）。若你有兩副完全相同的順子，得 1 番；若手中有兩組如此，得 3 番。"

msgid "Enables ippatsu. \\\"One-shot\\\". 1 han if you win before or during your next draw after riichi. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "啟用一發（「One-shot」）。若你在立直後下一次摸牌前或摸牌時和了，得 1 番。鳴牌會使其失效。"

msgid "Enables kansai yaku, namely: Three Consecutive Triplets (2 Han), Four Consecutive Triplets (Yakuman), Big Three Winds (2 Han), Manzu Chinitsu (Yakuman), Honitsu Chiitoitsu (6 Han), and Chinitsu Chiitoitsu (Yakuman). The last three don't stack with Honitsu/Chinitsu/Chiitoitsu."
msgstr "啟用關西役種，即：三連刻（2 番）、四連刻（役滿）、大三風（2 番）、萬子清一色（役滿）、混一色七對子（6 番）及清一色七對子（役滿）。後三項不與混一色／清一色／七對子疊加。"

msgid "Enables kin dora (gold fives), worth 3 han each."
msgstr "啟用金寶牌（金五），每張值 3 番。"

msgid "Enables menzentsumo. \\\"Closed Self-Draw\\\". 1 han if you win by self-draw without having called any tiles (except concealed kan)."
msgstr "啟用門前清自摸和（「Closed Self-Draw」）。若你在沒有鳴任何牌的情況下自摸和了（暗槓除外），得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables nippatsu. 1 han if you win during the second go-around after riichi ippatsu. Calls invalidate."
msgstr "啟用二發。若你在立直一發後的第二巡和了，得 1 番。鳴牌會使其失效。"

msgid "Enables pinfu. \\\"Minimal Fu\\\". 1 han if your hand is closed and only scores base fu (30 for ron and 20 for tsumo)."
msgstr "啟用平和（「Minimal Fu」）。若你的手牌門清且僅計基本符（榮和 30、自摸 20），得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables rinshan kaihou. \\\"Flower Blooming on the Mountain Range\\\". 1 han if you tsumo on your kan replacement tile."
msgstr "啟用嶺上開花（「Flower Blooming on the Mountain Range」）。若你以槓的補牌自摸，得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables tanyaochuu. \\\"Cut Honors And Terminals\\\". 1 han if your hand contains no terminals (1,9 tiles) or honor tiles."
msgstr "啟用斷么九（「Cut Honors And Terminals」）。若你的手牌不含么九牌（1、9）或字牌，得 1 番。"

msgid "Enables ura dora."
msgstr "啟用裡寶牌。"

msgid "Enables yakuhai. \\\"Value Triplets\\\". 1 han for each dragon triplet or kan, 1 han for a wind triplet or kan matching the round wind, and 1 han for a wind triplet or kan matching your seat. If a wind triplet or kan matches both the round wind or seat wind, you score both (2 han)."
msgstr "啟用役牌（「Value Triplets」）。每組三元牌刻子或槓得 1 番，與場風相符的風牌刻子或槓得 1 番，與自風相符的風牌刻子或槓得 1 番。若風牌刻子或槓同時與場風及自風相符，則兩者皆計（2 番）。"

