msgid "Go ahead and discard the 1 of characters. Note that you can also double click (mobile: double tap) to discard the drawn tile. You can also right click (mobile: hold down) to discard the drawn tile."
msgstr "請打出 1 萬。注意，你也可以連點兩下（行動裝置：連點兩下）來打出摸到的牌。你也可以按右鍵（行動裝置：長按）來打出摸到的牌。"

msgid "Go ahead and discard this east wind to continue."
msgstr "請打出這張東風以繼續。"

