msgstr "數字王牌（合）"

msgid "Number of points each player starts with. You can also set this by writing the following in the Config tab: \\\"initial_score\\\": 100000"
msgstr "每位玩家的起始點數。你也可以在「設定」分頁中寫下以下內容來設定：\\\"initial_score\\\": 100000"

msgid "OMM International 2026 Card"
msgstr "OMM 國際 2026 卡"

msgid "Obviously (since this is a tutorial) we get the 4 of characters immediately. Press Hu to see how this hand scores!"
msgstr "顯然地（因為這是教學課程），我們立刻摸到 4 萬。按下「和」來看看這手牌如何計分吧！"

msgid "Octuple Yakuman"
msgstr "八倍役滿"

msgid "Octuple Yakuman base"
msgstr "八倍役滿基本"

