msgid "Open fuutsu are worth 8 fu, and closed fuutsu are worth 16. Just like with kans, you get a replacement tile for calling fuun. Unlike with kans, this replacement tile comes from the live wall, not the dead wall."
msgstr "明風順值 8 符，暗風順值 16 符。與槓相同，鳴風順可獲得補牌。與槓不同的是，此補牌來自活牌山，而非王牌區。"

msgid "Opposing winds are also round winds. So in East round, West is also a round wind."
msgstr "對向的風牌也同為場風。因此東場時，西也同為場風。"

msgid "Orochi"
msgstr "大蛇"

msgid "Orochi (unimplemented)"
msgstr "大蛇（未實裝）"

msgid "Otakaze Sankou"
msgstr "客風三刻"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

msgid "Other players might make inferences about your hand based on your calls. In addition, you may no longer discard these tiles -- they are \\\"locked in\\\" for your hand."
msgstr "其他玩家可能會根據你的鳴牌推斷你的手牌。此外，你不能再打出這些牌——它們已「鎖定」在你的手牌中。"

msgid "Otherwise, the gold tile is a joker for any tile, but it cannot be used in calls."
msgstr "否則，金牌為任何牌的萬能牌，但不能用於鳴牌。"

msgid "Our Kong replacement tile is a 6 of characters. Since we have a wildcard in hand, we can either discard the 6 and wait on 1, 2, 3, 4, or 5 bamboo, or we could discard 2 bamboo to wait on any character tile except 9."
msgstr "我們的槓補牌是 6 萬。由於手中有一張萬能牌，我們可以打出 6 並聽 1、2、3、4 或 5 索，或打出 2 索並聽除 9 以外的任何萬子。"

msgid "Our initial hand is looking like it's going to be a half flush, but let's see."
msgstr "我們的起始手牌看起來會是混一色，但讓我們看看。"

