msgid "That's about all there is to galaxy mahjong! Feel free to keep playing with the bots."
msgstr "銀河麻將大概就是這樣！歡迎繼續與電腦玩家對戰。"

msgid "That's pretty much it for the basics, press Back on the upper right to return to the list of tutorials!"
msgstr "基本內容大概就是這樣，按右上角的「返回」回到教學課程清單！"

msgid "The 100 point sticks in the middle count honba. Each adds %{value} extra points to the winning value. One honba stick is added for every drawn round, and reset to 0 on a win."
msgstr "中間的百點棒用於計算本場。每根為和牌價值增加 %{value} 額外點數。每次流局增加一根本場棒，和了時歸零。"

msgid "The 19m tiles can be called as nukidora."
msgstr "19 萬可作為拔北鳴牌。"

msgid "The 7 Hun'er are 3+4 tiles: the 3 copies of what would be the dora indicator in Riichi (shown on upper left), and 4 copies of the next tile (like Riichi dora). All 7 tiles are considered Hun'er, and can be used as a wildcard tile."
msgstr "7 張混兒為 3+4 張：作為立直寶牌指示牌的三張（顯示於左上方），以及其下一張牌的四張（如同立直寶牌）。全部 7 張皆視為混兒，可作為萬能牌。"

msgid "The AI for most variants including Riichi use the standard AI, which simply discards towards the closest win condition."
msgstr "包含立直在內的大多數變體，其 AI 皆使用標準 AI，也就是單純朝最接近的和牌條件打牌。"

msgid "The Face, Animal, Flower, and Season tiles %{flowers} are all considered flower tiles. Their scoring is detailed in the Flowers tab. You also receive a bonus if you declare a set of 4 flowers, see the Rules tab for more details."
msgstr "人頭牌、動物牌、花牌及季節牌 %{flowers} 皆視為花牌。其計分詳見「花牌」分頁。若你宣告一組 4 張花牌，還可獲得獎勵，詳見「規則」分頁。"

msgid "The Fei Joker %{fei} is a wildcard that can stand for any tile. They may also be declared as flowers for 1 Fei each by pressing the Reveal Fei button."
msgstr "飛王牌 %{fei} 是可代表任何牌的萬能牌。按下「揭開飛」按鈕，也可各以 1 飛宣告為花牌。"

msgid "The anything joker %{tong} can be replaced for 3 Phán if you are the East player or if you replace it at the start of the game, or 2 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "萬能王牌 %{tong} 若你為東家或在遊戲開始時替換，可換取 3 番；否則換取 2 番。"

msgid "The bamboo joker %{sooc} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the West player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "索子王牌 %{sooc} 若你為西家，可換取 2 番；否則換取 1 番。"

msgid "The character joker %{man} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the North player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "萬子王牌 %{man} 若你為北家，可換取 2 番；否則換取 1 番。"

msgid "The classic riichi ruleset, now with an assortment of mods to pick and choose at your liking."
msgstr "經典立直規則集，現在搭配各式 mod 供你依喜好挑選。"

msgid "The dealer (who goes first) may also double down, essentially challenging all three players at once. This does not consume challenge tokens."
msgstr "莊家（先手）也可以加倍下注，本質上是一次挑戰全部三位玩家。此不消耗挑戰代幣。"

msgid "The dealer gets 2 points for each dealer continuation."
msgstr "莊家每次連莊可得 2 點。"

msgid "The dealer pays everyone a discard chase bonus of $amt"
msgstr "莊家向所有人支付 $amt 的追打獎勵"

msgid "The dealer won on their first draw."
msgstr "莊家以其第一次摸牌和了。"

msgid "The distinguishing factor of space mahjong is that sequences can wrap. In other words, 891 and 912 are valid sequences."
msgstr "宇宙麻將的顯著特色是順子可以循環。換句話說，891 和 912 皆為有效的順子。"

msgid "The dora indicator is a galaxy eight circles, which similarly indicates all nines as dora, including your nine of bamboo."
msgstr "寶牌指示牌是銀河八筒，同樣指示所有九為寶牌，包括你的九索。"

msgid "The dot joker %{thung} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the South player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "筒子王牌 %{thung} 若你為南家，可換取 2 番；否則換取 1 番。"

msgid "The dragon joker %{nguyen} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the West player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "三元牌王牌 %{nguyen} 若你為西家，可換取 2 番；否則換取 1 番。"

msgid "The endgame screen takes 30 seconds to advance. If you want it to take longer, toggle the \"Change AI Speed\" mod in Room Settings."
msgstr "終局畫面需要 30 秒才會前進。若你想讓它更久，請切換房間設定中的「變更 AI 速度」mod。"

msgid "The flower joker %{hoa} can be replaced for 2 Phán regardless of seat."
msgstr "花王牌 %{hoa} 不論座位，皆可換取 2 番。"

msgid "The game consists of two east rounds."
msgstr "遊戲由兩個東場組成。"

msgid "The game ends once the next draw is the last dora indicator."
msgstr "當下一次摸牌為最後一張寶牌指示牌時，遊戲結束。"

msgid "The gold tile is determined by checking each tile in the dead wall until you find a non-flower tile. Flowers revealed in this process are given to the player whose wall is broken. If all nine tiles on the dead wall are flowers, then there is no gold tile for the round."
msgstr "金牌的判定方式是逐一檢查王牌區的每張牌，直到找到非花牌為止。此過程中揭開的花牌會給予牌山被破開的玩家。若王牌區全部九張牌皆為花牌，則該局沒有金牌。"

msgid "The maximum hand value is 320 points. However, if your winning hand matches a pattern worth more than 320 points, score only that pattern and its points."
msgstr "手牌價值上限為 320 點。然而，若你的和牌手牌符合值超過 320 點的牌型，則僅計該牌型及其點數。"

msgid "The number joker %{hop} can be replaced for 3 Phán if you are the North player or if you replace it at the start of the game, or 2 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "數字王牌 %{hop} 若你為北家或在遊戲開始時替換，可換取 3 番；否則換取 2 番。"

msgid "The object of the game is to obtain four sets and a pair. A set is a sequence of three, like 123, or a triplet, like 555."
msgstr "遊戲目標是取得四組面子及一對雀頭。面子是三張的順子（如 123）或刻子（如 555）。"

msgid "The oldest written ruleset for Riichi, featuring 300 point riichi bets and no fu rounding."
msgstr "立直最古老的成文規則集，特色為 300 點的立直賭注及符不進位。"

msgid "The player across from you has just discarded the east wind, which you have two of."
msgstr "對家剛打出東風，而你手中有兩張。"

msgid "The player to our left has discarded a 6 of bamboo, which we'll need for Mixed Shifted, so go ahead and call it! In MCR, there are very few downsides to calling tiles."
msgstr "上家打出了 6 索，這是我們混龍所需的牌，儘管鳴吧！在 MCR 中，鳴牌的壞處極少。"

msgid "The player to your right just played the 2 of circles. In space mahjong, you can chii from any direction, not just from your left. Try it now!"
msgstr "下家剛打出 2 筒。在宇宙麻將中，你可以吃任何方向的牌，不僅限於上家。現在試試看！"

msgid "The previous player just tossed the 3 of circles, and it's about to be your turn."
msgstr "上一位玩家剛丟出 3 筒，馬上就輪到你了。"

msgid "The replacement tile gives us three sets and a pair, so we're tenpai. Now declare riichi on the 9 of bamboo!"
msgstr "補牌讓我們有了三組面子及一對雀頭，所以我們聽牌了。現在對 9 索宣告立直吧！"

msgid "The seven Hun'er are the three copies of the revealed tile, as well as the four copies of the next tile in sequence."
msgstr "七張混兒為揭開牌的其中三張，以及其順序下一張牌的四張。"

msgid "The tile next in sequence to a dora indicator is considered dora, and each copy of dora in hand is worth 1 extra han. A nine indicator %{nine} indicates the one %{one} as dora. For winds, the sequence is %{east} > %{south} > %{west} > %{north} > %{east}. For dragons, the sequence is %{white}, %{green}, %{red} > %{white}."
msgstr "寶牌指示牌的下一張牌視為寶牌，手中的每張寶牌值 1 額外番。九的指示牌 %{nine} 指示一 %{one} 為寶牌。風牌的順序為 %{east} > %{south} > %{west} > %{north} > %{east}。三元牌的順序為 %{white}、%{green}、%{red} > %{white}。"

msgid "The tsumo and ron buttons are enabled on every draw and discard. If you make an incorrect win call, your hand is dead and you cannot make a win call for the remainder of the round."
msgstr "每次摸牌與打牌時，自摸與榮和按鈕皆會啟用。若你做出錯誤的和牌宣告，你的手牌將成為死手，且在該局剩餘部分無法再宣告和牌。"

msgid "The uradora indicator is a galaxy white dragon. Since galaxy dragons are dragon wildcards, they indicate all other dragons as uradora, including your two actual white dragons."
msgstr "裡寶牌指示牌是銀河白。由於銀河三元牌為三元牌的萬能牌，它們指示所有其他三元牌為裡寶牌，包括你兩張真正的白。"

msgid "The very first thing you do (before seeing your hand!) is to up the ante by issuing challenges against the dealer (East player). (The dealer may do the same against all other players, but it is called Double Down.)"
msgstr "你做的第一件事（在看到手牌之前！）是透過向莊家（東家）發出挑戰來提高賭注。（莊家也可對所有其他玩家如此，但稱為加倍下注。）"

msgid "The wall also contains four each of the 1 to 9 of Stars %{stars}"
msgstr "牌山中也包含星牌 1 至 9 各 4 張 %{stars}"

msgid "The wall consists of:"
msgstr "牌山由以下組成："

msgid "The wall is composed of 16 copies of each bamboo tile."
msgstr "牌山由每種索子牌各 16 張組成。"

msgid "The wildcard could be used to make another set, either filling the 24 of bamboo, or making a triplet out of one of the pairs."
msgstr "萬能牌可用來組成另一組面子，無論是補齊 24 索，或將其中一對組成刻子。"

msgid "The wind joker %{hi} can be replaced for 2 Phán if you are the South player, or 1 Phán otherwise."
msgstr "風牌王牌 %{hi} 若你為南家，可換取 2 番；否則換取 1 番。"

msgid "There are 8 jokers in the game: %{jokers}."
msgstr "遊戲中有 8 張王牌：%{jokers}。"

msgid "There are by default 8 jokers %{joker} in the wall. Any amount of jokers can be used to call tiles. By default, calls that don't use any non-joker tiles are automatically skipped, but you can deactivate this behavior by toggling off the JC button on the bottom-left (you only need to do this once)."
msgstr "牌山中預設有 8 張王牌 %{joker}。鳴牌時可使用任意數量的王牌。預設情況下，不使用任何非王牌的鳴牌會自動跳過，但你可以透過關閉左下角的 JC 按鈕來停用此行為（只需做一次）。"

msgid "There are no abortive draws enabled."
msgstr "未啟用任何途中流局。"

msgid "There is a fourth suit, stars: %{stars}"
msgstr "有第四種花色，星：%{stars}"

msgid "These are the tiles that are purely green in color."
msgstr "這些是顏色純綠的牌。"

msgid "These are the tiles that look the same when inverted upside-down."
msgstr "這些是上下顛倒後看起來相同的牌。"

msgid "These tiles are considered terminals, so the nines %{nines} are no longer terminals."
msgstr "這些牌視為么九牌，因此九 %{nines} 不再是么九牌。"

msgid "Thirteen Orphans"
msgstr "十三么"

msgid "Thirteen Terminals"
msgstr "十三么"

msgid "Thirteen Unconnected"
msgstr "十三不靠"

msgid "Thirteen Wonders"
msgstr "十三么"

msgid "This draw (4 of circles) is ideal, not only because it lets us win on the 1 of characters (for Mixed Shifted 234 345 456)..."
msgstr "這次摸牌（4 筒）很理想，不僅因為它讓我們能聽 1 萬（以構成混龍 234 345 456）……"

msgid "This example hand is only awarded Four Concealed Pungs if the %{t} was self-drawn. Otherwise, it would award Three Concealed Pungs (16 Fan)."
msgstr "此範例手牌僅在 %{t} 為自摸時才計為四暗刻。否則將計為三暗刻（16 番）。"

msgid "This hand might score two instances of Two Terminal Chows (1+1 Fan) and two instances of Mixed Double Chow (1+1 Fan), but this creates a 'loop' connection with the four sets, and this is disallowed. You can only pick three of the four Fan to score, avoiding the loop."
msgstr "此手牌可能計兩次么九順（1+1 番）及兩次混二連順（1+1 番），但這會與四組面子形成「迴圈」連結，因此不被允許。你只能從這四個番中挑選三個計分，以避免迴圈。"

msgid "This invalidates No Jokers bonuses, including No Jokers Mosquito Hand."
msgstr "這會使無王牌獎勵失效，包括無王牌蚊子手。"

msgid "This is a tutorial, so of course you get the tile you want immediately. Press Ron."
msgstr "這是教學課程，所以當然會立刻摸到你想要的牌。按下「榮和」。"

msgid "This is another example, you can only score two of the Fan among Mixed Straight (8 Fan), Two Terminal Chows (1 Fan), and Mixed Double Chow (1 Fan)."
msgstr "這是另一個例子，你只能從混龍（8 番）、么九順（1 番）及混二連順（1 番）中挑選兩個番計分。"

msgid "This is because calling Kong in Tianjin gives an immediate payout of 1 point."
msgstr "這是因為在天津麻將中鳴槓可立即獲得 1 點的支付。"

msgid "This is because galaxy tiles are suitless! A galaxy 2 can be used as any 2 tile, including 2 of bamboo. So we could chii 234, if we wished."
msgstr "這是因為銀河牌沒有花色！銀河二可作為任何 2 牌，包括 2 索。所以若我們願意，可以吃成 234。"

msgid "This is your hand. Whenever it's your turn, you will automatically draw a tile and discard a tile."
msgstr "這是你的手牌。每當輪到你時，你會自動摸一張牌並打出一張牌。"

msgid "This means that your 91 in circles is actually a double-sided wait for 8 and 2. Pretty silly, right? Let's try going for sanshoku on 912."
msgstr "這意味著你的筒子 91 實際上是聽 8 和 2 的兩面聽。挺傻的吧？讓我們試著在 912 上追求三色同順。"

msgid "This rule only takes effect for Fan that care about arrangements of sets, so other Fan like Tile Hog (2 Fan) and All Simples (2 Fan) are unaffected."
msgstr "此規則僅對在意面子排列的番種生效，因此如四歸一（2 番）及斷么九（2 番）等其他番種不受影響。"

